<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="brand">手写数字识别</view>
    <view class="headline">从一笔书写，\n开始数字识别之旅</view>
    <view class="subline">W1 本地原型：仅书写与 PNG 导出预览，尚未接入识别</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">账号登录</view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">用户名</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        value="{{username}}"
        data-field="username"
        placeholder="请输入用户名"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">密码</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        password
        value="{{password}}"
        data-field="password"
        placeholder="请输入密码"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>
    <button class="btn" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="submit">
      登录业务首页
    </button>
    <view class="hint">演示账号：admin / admin123</view>
  </view>

  <view class="prototype-entry">
    <button class="prototype-btn" bindtap="openDrawingPrototype">免登录体验 W1 本地画板</button>
    <view class="prototype-note">仅书写 / 导出预览，不上传、不识别；业务首页仍需登录。</view>
  </view>
</view>
